<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Static sitemap for hosts that serve frontend/ directly (Vercel).
  backend/server.js ALSO generates this dynamically from the live request host,
  which takes priority on Render. Keep the two URL lists (and their images)
  in sync. lastmod is updated whenever the page content changes.

  The <image:image> blocks are a Google image sitemap: they tell Google which
  photos to associate with which page, including title + caption, so the
  portrait can surface in Google Images for "Rashi Sharma web developer".
-->
